<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Harmony Sept qtr net profit up.</title>
<headline>Harmony Sept qtr net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital spending  20.25 vs 18.68</p>
<p>    Capital spending			   8.78 vs  5.64</p>
<p>Tonnes milled</p>
<p>	- Underground		     1,270,000 vs 1,240,000</p>
<p>	- Surface			     412,000 vs   412,000</p>
<p>Gold output (kg)</p>
<p>	- Underground			   4,911 vs 3,670</p>
<p>	- Surface				   130 vs   145</p>
<p>Yield (gram/t)</p>
<p>	- Underground			    3.87 vs 3.77</p>
<p>	- Surface				  0.32 vs 0.35</p>
<p>Cost (rand/kg)</p>
<p>	- Underground			 49,769  vs 47,354</p>
<p>	- Surface			     24,775  vs 20,269</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     55,098  vs 51,335</p>
<p>Full name: Harmony Gold Mining Ltd, managed by Randgold and Exploration Co Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
